@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### Read all products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Read products by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### Add a product
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keyboard",
  "price": 49.99,
  "quantity": 1
}

### Delete product by id
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/3